# Build a Premium Minimalist Attendance Permission App Frontend

Design and build a **production-quality, minimalist web application** called **PermitCS**. The UI should feel like a blend of **Apple, Linear, Notion, and Raycast**—clean, elegant, and distraction-free. Prioritize usability over decoration.

## Design Principles

* Extremely minimal interface
* Plenty of whitespace
* Clean typography
* No gradients
* No glassmorphism
* No neumorphism
* No skeuomorphic effects
* No colorful dashboard cards
* No unnecessary illustrations
* No shadows heavier than subtle elevation
* Focus on content instead of decoration
* Every screen should have only one primary action

The interface should feel calm, modern, and premium.

